The 2026-09-22 commit that added reconcile-schema.sql only touched
CHANGELOG.md, CLAUDE.md, Index/README.md, and reconcile-schema.sql — it
never modified Index/index.html, which still shows the generic
"ยังไม่ได้สร้าง UI ส่วนนี้" placeholder for view-reconcile. Both docs
wrongly described a full Excel-upload/scan/report UI as already built.
This corrects the record before the real feature is implemented.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017pGC9JYYL1kKxCkMpsrWzf
